WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.346
Banners are on Quick update.

2
00:00:02.346 --> 00:00:04.788
Put up a banner: it stays
until a day you pick.

3
00:00:04.788 --> 00:00:09.410
One short sentence.

4
00:00:09.410 --> 00:00:12.653
It comes down by itself after this day.

5
00:00:12.653 --> 00:00:15.177
Press the button. It is up in a few minutes.

6
00:00:15.177 --> 00:00:17.518
For a snow day, go back to the list.

7
00:00:17.518 --> 00:00:20.044
Cancel or change something this week.

8
00:00:20.044 --> 00:00:22.376
It makes a red banner.

9
00:00:22.376 --> 00:00:28.468
Say what is changing.

10
00:00:28.468 --> 00:00:33.108
It comes down by itself after Sunday.
